  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/06/P1620330.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(28 fotos) L&#39;Ajuntament d&#39;Onda ha homenatjat aquest dimarts als esportistes d&#39;Adaponda que han participat aquest cap de setmana en el Campionat d&#39;Espanya per Seleccions Auton&ograve;miques de nataci&oacute; de Feddi Espanya i s&#39;han proclamat campions.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/recepcioadapondanatacioselecciocv/p1620329.jpg\" alt=\"p1620329\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/recepcioadapondanatacioselecciocv/p1620330.jpg\" alt=\"p1620330\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/recepcioadapondanatacioselecciocv/p1620331.jpg\" alt=\"p1620331\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/recepcioadapondanatacioselecciocv/p1620333.jpg\" alt=\"p1620333\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/recepcioadapondanatacioselecciocv/p1620335.jpg\" alt=\"p1620335\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/recepcioadapondanatacioselecciocv/p1620336.jpg\" alt=\"p1620336\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/recepcioadapondanatacioselecciocv/p1620337.jpg\" alt=\"p1620337\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/recepcioadapondanatacioselecciocv/p1620338.jpg\" alt=\"p1620338\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/recepcioadapondanatacioselecciocv/p1620339.jpg\" alt=\"p16